# Dunit Userspace ABI v0 — handle-rights manifest (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH).
#
# One line per capability bit: <bit index> <NAME>. A handle's rights only ever
# narrow (never widen) when transferred. tools/gen_abi.py regenerates the
# consumers and refuses to run if kernel/src/handle.rs disagrees:
#   - userspace/libdunit/src/rights_numbers.rs  (Rust: pub const RIGHT_<NAME>)
#   - abi/include/dunit/rights.h                (C:    #define DUNIT_RIGHT_<NAME>)

0	READ
1	WRITE
2	MAP
3	SIGNAL
4	TRANSFER
5	DISPLAY_MASTER
6	INPUT_MASTER
